5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m tired of doing mental math before turning on the heater. I want to know what the rooms actually need.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the real numbers. The current split feels arbitrary and I want to verify the costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is doing the math every month? It’s taking forever and I hate being the one to ask.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We’re all different people now. The old split doesn’t fit. I want to see if anyone is overpaying.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’m worried about the tension. I want to see how the money has affected our conversations lately.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, I feel you. I don’t want to be the one sweating in a coat again.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, comfort is important, but I need the data first. I’ll check the statements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I agree. If we know who uses what, maybe the math gets easier?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, exactly. I’ll look at the room usage. Let’s stop guessing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, I’ll check the payment log. I want to see where the friction is coming from.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the sunlight and heating needs. I need to know which rooms are cold.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll check the last twelve utility statements. I need to see the seasonal spikes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the monthly settle at another house. I want to see how long it takes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the plug-in monitor readings. I need to see the actual usage per room.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll check the payment log. I want to see the delays and the arguments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
