35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The cooler notice stayed up all summer. People sweated rather than argue. That’s not living.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"February was 29,400 yen. August was 9,100. The variance is huge. A flat rate is impossible.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The other house spent forty minutes just logging readings. That’s a part-time job. I can’t do that.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,One room uses four times more than another. The old split is definitely unfair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Three months were paid late because people queried the amounts. The money is poisoning us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if the bills swing that much, how do we budget? I need predictability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, predictability requires a fixed rate, but the variance is too high. We need meters.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if one room uses so much, shouldn’t they pay more? But who checks?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the monitor shows it clearly. But the setup when the last rooms filled took three weeks.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, I agree. The uncertainty causes the arguments. We need a system that removes the guesswork.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, I don’t want to be the one checking meters. I just want to be warm without guilt.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That’s a big upfront cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, 34,000 yen? That’s a lot. But if it saves me from the monthly grind, maybe?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the upfront cost is high, but the fairness is worth it. I’m leaning towards meters.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, I agree. If we know exactly what we owe, the arguments stop.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I’m worried about the cost, but I hate the current system.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The cost is high, but the data is clear. Meters are the only logical solution.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I’m scared of the work, but I’m scared of the arguments more.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The data supports meters. Let’s go with that.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I support meters. It removes the ambiguity that causes the tension.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
